{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">[03:00]</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台：<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, \"sans-serif\", \"microsoft jhenghei\";'>與高空擾動相關的驟雨及雷暴持續在珠江口一帶發展，預料未來兩三小時本港部分地區雨勢頗大。市民應留意天氣變化。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T19:19:48.511756+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":66,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}